  "Making videos or posts about OutBrick? Ideas that work, the brand dos and don’ts, downloadable art, suggested hashtags and how to disclose partnerships.": "¿Haces vídeos o publicaciones sobre OutBrick? Ideas que funcionan, normas de marca, gráficos descargables, hashtags sugeridos y cómo indicar colaboraciones.",
