  "If anything was given, say so.": "Si recibiste algo, dilo.",
  "If you use an affiliate link, were paid, or received anything from OutBrick — a promo code, the Brick Pass, early access — say so clearly at the start of the post, not buried in hashtags. It is required by the FTC in the US, the ASA and CAP Code in the UK, and similar rules elsewhere.": "Si usas un enlace de afiliación, has recibido un pago o algo de OutBrick —un código promocional, Brick Pass, acceso anticipado—, indícalo claramente al principio, no entre hashtags. Lo exigen la FTC en Estados Unidos, la ASA y el CAP Code en Reino Unido y reglas similares en otros lugares.",
  "Use your platform’s paid-partnership or branded-content label where it has one": "Usa la etiqueta de colaboración pagada o contenido de marca de la plataforma si existe",
