  "Meet the nine brick friends of OutBrick: Bloo, Peach, Sprout, Bricko, Flurry, Moss, Poppy, Vio and Zippy. Three share your Home screen at a time.": "Conoce a los nueve amigos de ladrillo de OutBrick: Bloo, Peach, Sprout, Bricko, Flurry, Moss, Poppy, Vio y Zippy. Tres comparten tu inicio a la vez.",
