  "OutBrick 4.2 arrives on the App Store — press release": "OutBrick 4.2 llega al App Store: comunicado de prensa",
  "OutBrick 4.2 is on the App Store: 2,000 solver-verified boards, 167 brick villages and nine brick friends, on iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple TV, Vision Pro and Watch.": "OutBrick 4.2 está en el App Store: 2000 tableros verificados, 167 pueblos de ladrillo y nueve amigos en iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple TV, Vision Pro y Watch.",
