  "Press release · For immediate release": "Comunicado de prensa · Publicación inmediata",
  "· OutBrick": "· OutBrick",
  "Press release text": "Texto del comunicado",
  "— OutBrick 4.2, the current version of": "— OutBrick 4.2, la versión actual de",
  ", is available now on the App Store. It was released on 22 September 2026 for iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple TV and Apple Vision Pro, with a standalone game for Apple Watch.": ", ya está disponible en el App Store. Se publicó el 22 de septiembre de 2026 para iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple TV y Apple Vision Pro, con un juego independiente para Apple Watch.",
  "OutBrick is a sliding-brick colour-sort puzzle. Slide a brick and it glides until something stops it; get every brick out through the gate that matches its colour and the board is clear. There are 2,000 boards across 100 chapters, and a solver cleared every one of them before it shipped, so no board a player meets is a dead end.": "OutBrick es un puzle de ladrillos deslizantes para ordenar colores. Desliza un ladrillo y avanza hasta que algo lo detiene; saca cada ladrillo por la puerta de su color y el tablero queda despejado. Hay 2000 tableros en cien capítulos y un solucionador despejó cada uno antes de publicarlo, así que ningún tablero es un callejón sin salida.",
  "Between boards, the Journey is a boulevard of 167 villages built entirely from brick, and nine brick friends — Bloo, Peach, Sprout, Bricko, Flurry, Moss, Poppy, Vio and Zippy — take turns on the home screen, each with a victory move of their own.": "Entre tableros, el Viaje es un bulevar de 167 pueblos hechos enteramente de ladrillos, y nueve amigos —Bloo, Peach, Sprout, Bricko, Flurry, Moss, Poppy, Vio y Zippy— se turnan en el inicio, cada uno con su celebración propia.",
  "Pressure without a clock": "Presión sin reloj",
  "Every board shows a move target and a move limit from the first tap; there is no timer or countdown anywhere in the game. The first undo on every board is free. Players hold five lives, eight with the Brick Pass, and a life is spent only when an attempt ends without a clear.": "Cada tablero muestra un objetivo y límite de movimientos desde el primer toque; no hay temporizador ni cuenta atrás. El primer deshacer de cada tablero es gratis. Tienes cinco vidas, ocho con Brick Pass, y solo se consume una cuando un intento termina sin despejar.",
  "OutBrick is free. Advertising is rewarded video only, in six opt-in placements, each capped daily; there are no banners or interstitials and nothing interrupts a board. Remove Ads switches advertising off for good, and the Brick Pass turns it off while it is held. There is no subscription.": "OutBrick es gratis. La publicidad consiste solo en vídeos con recompensa en seis ubicaciones voluntarias, cada una con tope diario; no hay banners ni intersticiales y nada interrumpe un tablero. Remove Ads desactiva la publicidad para siempre y Brick Pass la desactiva mientras lo tengas. No hay suscripción.",
  "Built for Apple, built for everyone": "Creado para Apple, creado para todos",
  "Colour-blind glyphs are on by default, every brick is a VoiceOver element, and Larger Text and Reduce Motion are honoured. OutBrick supports Live Activities, widgets, Game Center with 57 achievements, iMessage stickers and challenges, Siri and Shortcuts, and iCloud sync, so progress follows a player from one device to the next.": "Los símbolos para daltonismo están activos por defecto, cada ladrillo es un elemento de VoiceOver y se respetan Texto más grande y Reducir movimiento. OutBrick admite Actividades en directo, widgets, Game Center con 57 logros, stickers y desafíos de iMessage, Siri y Atajos y sincronización de iCloud, para llevar el progreso entre dispositivos.",
